    faqs: [['What is included?', 'The proposal defines technical review, content work, implementation responsibilities and reporting. Not every recommendation can be completed in the same cycle; the priority backlog makes those choices visible.'], ['How are priorities chosen?', 'We consider relevance to your business, evidence of a problem, likely impact and effort. A broken enquiry journey can take priority over adding another article.'], ['What access do you need?', 'Usually the website, Search Console and existing analytics. We request the permissions needed for the agreed work and identify where your developer should make changes.'], ['How do we judge progress?', 'Compare a documented baseline with search discovery, priority-page performance and verified enquiries. Seasonal demand and other campaigns need to be considered alongside SEO changes.'], ['Can you promise a first-page position?', 'No. Search platforms control their results, and competitors and demand change. We can agree the work, explain decisions and report the evidence.']],
