    scope: [['Brand information inventory', 'Record your business name, services, locations and approved product facts. Find contradictions between key pages and relevant profiles. Only publish locations and credentials you can verify.'], ['Content and source gaps', 'Compare the questions in your buying journey with the explanations and evidence available. Identify where original expertise, detailed specifications or a useful comparison would add substance.'], ['Relevant external references', 'Review appropriate industry listings, existing mentions and editorial opportunities. Outreach seeks relevant coverage; it cannot require a publisher or AI system to repeat a claim.'], ['Platform-aware research', 'Check applicable crawl and access guidance, then sample selected queries. Keep platform conditions and dates with the observations so changing answers are not mistaken for stable rankings.']],
