    faqs: [['Is optimisation the same as a rewrite?', 'Not always. Some pages need structure or metadata changes; others need more substantial content. We recommend the level of change after reviewing the page.'], ['Which pages should come first?', 'Usually the pages closest to your commercial priorities, especially where search data or customer feedback exposes a clear mismatch.'], ['Can our developer implement the work?', 'Yes. Recommendations can identify the URL, proposed edit and validation steps so your team can publish them. Implementation responsibility is agreed in the proposal.'], ['How are changes monitored?', 'Keep a dated change log and compare relevant search and enquiry data over an appropriate period, accounting for demand changes and other site edits.'], ['Does this fix technical SEO?', 'It can reveal technical issues, but wider crawl, template or infrastructure work may require a managed SEO or development scope.']],
