    example: [['Opportunity', 'A relevant industry guide has an outdated resource link.'], ['Contribution', 'An accurate, maintained guide offers readers a useful replacement.'], ['Outcome record', 'Log the response and any independently chosen coverage.']],
    faqs: [["What is off-page SEO, and how is it different from on-page SEO?","Off-page SEO focuses on references and discovery beyond your own website, including relevant backlinks, brand mentions and business citations. On-page SEO improves the content, structure and relevance of your own pages. Both support a wider SEO strategy."],["What makes a backlink valuable for my business?","A useful backlink appears in a relevant context, on a site with a genuine reason to reference your page. We consider the audience, editorial quality, destination page and potential referral value. A high third-party domain score alone does not establish quality."],["Which link-building methods do you use?","The agreed scope can include backlink audits, competitor research, editorial outreach, useful resource promotion, link reclamation and relevant listings. Outreach uses accurate, approved business information and a contribution that makes sense for the reader."],["Do you offer off-page SEO services outside Hyderabad?","Yes. JustGrow is based in Hyderabad and can support businesses across India. Opportunity selection follows your industry, customers and target market, whether those customers are local or national."],["How long does off-page SEO take to show progress?","Research and outreach activity can be reported from the start. Earned coverage depends on publisher responses and editorial schedules, while search changes also depend on your website and competition. We agree review points and assess progress over time rather than promising a fixed ranking date."],["Can you guarantee backlinks or first-page rankings?","No. Publishers decide what to include, and search engines decide rankings. We commit to the agreed research, outreach and reporting work, then report the outcomes that actually occur."],["Do you buy links or use private blog networks?","No. We focus on relevant outreach and references rather than paid ranking links, private blog networks or automated link creation. Any separately agreed advertising or sponsored placement should be disclosed and use appropriate link attributes."],["Do I need to improve my website before starting?","Your destination pages should be accessible, useful and relevant to the outreach. If content or technical issues prevent a good experience, we flag them and agree whether on-page or technical work should come first."],["What will I receive in the reporting?","Your report covers selected opportunities, outreach activity, responses, earned placements and follow-up priorities. Where tracking is available, it also reviews relevant referral visits and enquiries. We agree the reporting frequency in the proposal."]],
